message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it using the metadata below. After publication, please also cite the associated article (see preferred-citation)."
type: software
title: "OHDSI GIS toolchain: documentation, GIS vocabulary tools, and synthetic benchmark and tutorial datasets"
abstract: >-
  Documentation, GIS vocabulary tooling, and generators, scripts and inputs for the synthetic tutorial and
  benchmark datasets of the OHDSI GIS toolchain, which integrates geospatial data with the OMOP Common Data
  Model through a geometry-attribute index and two OMOP extension tables (LOCATION_HISTORY and
  EXTERNAL_EXPOSURE). The database (GaiaDB), R package (GaiaCore), metadata catalog (GaiaCatalog) and deployment
  (GaiaDocker) are developed in separate repositories. All persons, addresses and outcomes in the datasets are synthetic.
version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it using the metadata below. After publication, please also cite the associated article (see preferred-citation)."
type: software
title: "OHDSI GIS toolchain: documentation, GIS vocabulary tools, and synthetic benchmark and tutorial datasets"
abstract: >-
  Open-source infrastructure that integrates geospatial data with the OMOP Common Data Model,
  including a geometry-attribute index, OMOP extension tables (LOCATION_HISTORY and
  EXTERNAL_EXPOSURE), an R analysis package, a FAIR metadata catalog, a GIS vocabulary,
  and a synthetic benchmark and tutorial dataset generator. All datasets are synthetic.
